Input: {"question": "In which significant event was Patterned shielding structure and integrated inductor involved?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 57, "text": "**Patterned Shielding Structure and Integrated Inductor**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 59, "end": 236, "text": "The Patterned Shielding Structure and Integrated Inductor is a technological innovation that has been involved in a significant legal filing, as evidenced by US patent 11387315."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 237, "end": 251, "text": "**Background**"}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 253, "end": 425, "text": "The Patterned Shielding Structure and Integrated Inductor is a design concept that combines the functions of electromagnetic shielding and inductance in a single component."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 426, "end": 544, "text": "This innovative structure has been developed to address the growing need for efficient and compact electronic devices."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 545, "end": 560, "text": "**Description**"}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 562, "end": 687, "text": "The Patterned Shielding Structure and Integrated Inductor consists of a patterned shielding layer and an integrated inductor."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 688, "end": 866, "text": "The patterned shielding layer is designed to provide effective electromagnetic shielding, while the integrated inductor enables the component to function as an inductive element."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 867, "end": 1027, "text": "This integrated design allows for a reduction in the overall size and complexity of electronic devices, making it an attractive solution for modern electronics."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1028, "end": 1044, "text": "**Significance**"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1046, "end": 1188, "text": "The Patterned Shielding Structure and Integrated Inductor has been involved in a significant legal filing, as evidenced by US patent 11387315."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1189, "end": 1362, "text": "This patent filing demonstrates the importance of this innovation in the field of electronics and highlights its potential to revolutionize the design of electronic devices."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1363, "end": 1375, "text": "**Evidence**"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1377, "end": 1458, "text": "* US Patent 11387315: \"Patterned shielding structure and integrated inductor\" [1]"}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1459, "end": 1561, "text": "* Patent filing documents, available through the United States Patent and Trademark Office (USPTO) [2]"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1563, "end": 1577, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1579, "end": 1625, "text": "[1] United States Patent and Trademark Office."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1626, "end": 1633, "text": "(2022)."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1634, "end": 1644, "text": "Patent No."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1645, "end": 1709, "text": "11387315: Patterned shielding structure and integrated inductor."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1710, "end": 1756, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/patents.uspto.gov\\/>"}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1758, "end": 1804, "text": "[2] United States Patent and Trademark Office."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1805, "end": 1812, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1813, "end": 1837, "text": "Patent Filing Documents."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1838, "end": 1884, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/patents.uspto.gov\\/>"}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1886, "end": 2203, "text": "This Wikipedia entry provides comprehensive evidence for the statement \"Patterned shielding structure and integrated inductor was involved in the significant event filing\" by presenting a clear and concise description of the innovation, its significance, and the evidence supporting its involvement in a legal filing."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 149, "text": "As the sun set over the ravaged cityscape, Captain Rachel Jenkins gazed out at the devastation, her mind reeling with the sheer scale of destruction."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 150, "end": 309, "text": "The once-thriving metropolis now lay in ruins, its buildings reduced to rubble and its streets littered with the remnants of what was once a vibrant community."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 310, "end": 452, "text": "The air was thick with the acrid smell of smoke and ozone, a constant reminder of the bombardment that had ravaged the city just hours before."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 453, "end": 553, "text": "Rachel's thoughts were interrupted by the arrival of her trusted engineer, Lieutenant Michael Patel."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 554, "end": 628, "text": "His usually stoic expression was etched with concern as he approached her."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 629, "end": 748, "text": "\"Captain, we've managed to salvage some of the wreckage from the research facility,\" he said, his voice low and urgent."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 749, "end": 853, "text": "\"But we need to be careful – whatever was being developed there, it was clearly a high-priority target.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 854, "end": 935, "text": "Rachel's eyes narrowed as she followed Michael through the rubble-strewn streets."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 936, "end": 1073, "text": "They eventually arrived at a makeshift command center, where a team of technicians was frantically working to analyze the recovered data."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1074, "end": 1253, "text": "Amidst the chaos, one piece of equipment caught Rachel's eye – a mangled, yet strangely intact, component with an intricate pattern of shielding and a coiled inductor at its core."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1254, "end": 1269, "text": "\"What is this?\""}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1270, "end": 1305, "text": "Rachel asked, her curiosity piqued."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1306, "end": 1377, "text": "Michael hesitated before responding, \"We're not entirely sure, Captain."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1378, "end": 1476, "text": "But from what we've gathered, it appears to be a prototype for a new type of shielding technology."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1477, "end": 1626, "text": "The patterned structure is designed to absorb and redirect electromagnetic pulses, while the integrated inductor helps to stabilize the energy flow.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1627, "end": 1703, "text": "Rachel's gaze lingered on the device, her mind racing with the implications."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1704, "end": 1801, "text": "This technology could have been a game-changer in the war against the enemy's advanced artillery."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1802, "end": 1858, "text": "But why had they targeted this facility so specifically?"}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1859, "end": 1925, "text": "And what secrets lay hidden in the ruins, waiting to be uncovered?"}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1926, "end": 2071, "text": "As she pondered these questions, a faint hum began to emanate from the device, its patterned shielding structure glowing with a soft, blue light."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2072, "end": 2236, "text": "Rachel felt an inexplicable shiver run down her spine – it was as if the very fabric of the technology was trying to convey a message, one that only she could hear."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2237, "end": 2338, "text": "In that moment, Rachel knew that she had stumbled upon something much larger than a simple prototype."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2339, "end": 2472, "text": "This was a clue, a thread that could unravel the mysteries of the bombardment and lead her to the truth about the enemy's intentions."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["filing of US patent 11387315", "prototype for a new type of shielding technology"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "filing of US patent 11387315", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "prototype for a new type of shielding technology", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
